    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="✨"
    title="sparkles"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2728.svg"> 01/12/2025 - Gjeorgjia</strong>

Lot&#235;t e tu nuk jan&#235; nj&#235; thyerje —
jan&#235; nj&#235; pastrim.

Kur l&#235;shon pesh&#235;n q&#235; nuk ishte kurr&#235; menduar ta mbaje,
krijon hap&#235;sir&#235; p&#235;r nj&#235; g&#235;zim m&#235; t&#235; q&#235;ndruesh&#235;m —
at&#235; lloj q&#235; bota nuk mund ta l&#235;kund&#235;,
sepse &#235;sht&#235; i ankoruar n&#235; t&#235; v&#235;rtet&#235;n e qet&#235; brenda teje.

L&#235;sho.
Hidhu p&#235;rpara.
Beso procesin e shnd&#235;rrimit.
G&#235;zimi t&#235; pret n&#235; hapin e guximsh&#235;m.

