<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1476499547663503451 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1476499547663503451><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, February 26, 2026 12:42 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1476499547663503451>2/26/2026 12:42 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Rezonanc&#235; drejt Kontrollit <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚠️"
    title="warning"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/26a0.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129504;"
    title="brain"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f9e0.svg"> 04/01/2026 - Gjeorgjia</strong>

Kjo video p&#235;rshkruan nj&#235; model shkat&#235;rrues q&#235; kam v&#235;zhguar n&#235; disa transmetime live n&#235; rrjetet sociale — dhe, n&#235; retrospektiv&#235;, n&#235; momente t&#235; ndryshme t&#235; jet&#235;s sime.

Shpesh fillon me rezonanc&#235;: nj&#235; p&#235;rvoj&#235; e p&#235;rbashk&#235;t, gjuh&#235; e njohur ose nj&#235; kuptim q&#235; ndihet i v&#235;rtet&#235;. Por sapo fillon angazhimi, ajo rezonanc&#235; mund t&#235; p&#235;rmbyset n&#235; kontroll. P&#235;rkat&#235;sia b&#235;het e kusht&#235;zuar. V&#235;nia n&#235; pyetje nd&#235;shkohet. Bindja z&#235;vend&#235;son mir&#235;kuptimin.

Me kalimin e koh&#235;s, struktura p&#235;rforcohet jo vet&#235;m nga ata q&#235; e drejtojn&#235;, por edhe nga pjes&#235;marr&#235;s q&#235; p&#235;rs&#235;risin narrativ&#235;n, shp&#235;rblejn&#235; konformitetin dhe amplifikojn&#235; shk&#235;putjen. Autoriteti p&#235;rfiton ata n&#235; qend&#235;r, nd&#235;rsa t&#235; tjer&#235;t qeverisen pa i p&#235;rkitur v&#235;rtet.

Kjo dinamik&#235; &#235;sht&#235; njohur prej koh&#235;sh. Si&#231; paralajm&#235;ron Shkrimi:

“Mbret&#235;rit e kombeve sundojn&#235; mbi ta; dhe ata q&#235; ushtrojn&#235; autoritet mbi ta e quajn&#235; veten bamir&#235;s.”
— Luka 22:25–26

N&#235; form&#235;n e saj m&#235; ekstreme, ky model p&#235;rshkall&#235;zohet duke paraqitur vet&#235;shkat&#235;rrimin si arratisje.

Kjo nuk &#235;sht&#235; filozofi.
Kjo nuk &#235;sht&#235; spiritualitet.
&#203;sht&#235; nj&#235; model psikologjik shkat&#235;rrues.

E v&#235;rteta nuk k&#235;rkon vet&#235;shkat&#235;rrim.
Jeta mbetet pika e referenc&#235;s.

