<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1510191688600260699 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1510191688600260699><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Saturday, May 30, 2026 12:02 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1510191688600260699>5/30/2026 12:02 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>CTRL + ALT + DELETE - Kodi i &#199;do Marr&#235;dh&#235;nieje 24/10/2025 - Turqi</strong>

&#199;do lidhje fillon me admirimin e asaj q&#235; na b&#235;n t&#235; ndrysh&#235;m.
Por pastaj vjen d&#235;shira p&#235;r t&#235; kontrolluar, p&#235;r t&#235; ndryshuar dhe kur rezistenca ngrihet - p&#235;r t&#235; fshir&#235;.

Megjithat&#235;, shpirti nuk ishte menduar kurr&#235; t&#235; korrigjohej nga nj&#235; tjet&#235;r.
Ai &#235;sht&#235; tashm&#235; i p&#235;rsosur n&#235; m&#235;nyr&#235; t&#235; pap&#235;rsosur.

N&#235; momentin q&#235; p&#235;rpiqemi t&#235; rishkruajm&#235; thelbin e dikujt, luftojm&#235; urdhrin m&#235; t&#235; vjet&#235;r q&#235; ekziston:
&quot;Njih veten&quot;.

T&#235; duash nuk do t&#235; thot&#235; t&#235; redaktosh.
T&#235; dish nuk do t&#235; thot&#235; t&#235; zot&#235;rosh.
T&#235; lidhesh nuk do t&#235; thot&#235; t&#235; kontrollosh.

